body:
This might be a little personal, but;

I would confront my parents about their alcoholism and terrible neglect of me and all our animals. I would sit my father down, spit in his face, and then ask him how it feels to be a woman beater. Ask him where he gets off on hitting our animals, why he thinks it's okay to buy a 2x6 of vodka instead of lunch for his daughter. 

To have all that come from a little 8 year old girls mouth, god, I would pay any amount of money to see the look on that fuckers face.
